   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VNC104 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Vietnamese Culture — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13353 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VNC104 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Vietnamese Culture — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13353 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">VNC104</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Vietnamese Culture _ Cơ sở văn hóa Việt Nam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br>= 45h contact hours + 1h final exam + 104h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Presenting,Field trip,discussion,groupwork</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13353</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">8/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">VNC104</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Vietnamese Culture _ Cơ sở văn hóa Việt Nam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br>= 45h contact hours + 1h final exam + 104h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Presenting,Field trip,discussion,groupwork</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13353</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">8/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>This course is designed to provide students with a understanding of the foundations and the dimensions of Vietnamese culture, origin, characteristic; pay particular attention to the relationship between Vietnamese culture and the present-day life of the Vietnamese people and to the different elements of the culture which are under the social structures, belief systems, literature, arts, customs, etc... Topics mainly include: (1) the foundations of Vietnamese civilization: its geography, language, and history; (2) the core concepts in Vietnamese thoughts and religions: Aninism, Taoism, Buddhism, Confucianism, Catholicism, the new sects religion;...(3) Literature (4) Society and Life, including education, the role of women, Vietnamese food, festivals and leisure activities ; (5) Arts and Architecture (6) Vietnamese performing arts like Ca trù, Tuồng, Hát Bội...<br>-Teaching method: Presentation, Discussion, teamwork, critical thinking, field-trip.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>This course is designed to provide students with a understanding of the foundations and the dimensions of Vietnamese culture, origin, characteristic; pay particular attention to the relationship between Vietnamese culture and the present-day life of the Vietnamese people and to the different elements of the culture which are under the social structures, belief systems, literature, arts, customs, etc... Topics mainly include: (1) the foundations of Vietnamese civilization: its geography, language, and history; (2) the core concepts in Vietnamese thoughts and religions: Aninism, Taoism, Buddhism, Confucianism, Catholicism, the new sects religion;...(3) Literature (4) Society and Life, including education, the role of women, Vietnamese food, festivals and leisure activities ; (5) Arts and Architecture (6) Vietnamese performing arts like Ca trù, Tuồng, Hát Bội...<br>-Teaching method: Presentation, Discussion, teamwork, critical thinking, field-trip.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13353\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13353</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13353\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13353</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
